                                                                     2 1451
 liquid para hydrogen at 20k computed with leapr.                    2 1451
 the scattering law is based on the model of keinert and sax,        2 1451
 which includes spin correlations from the young and koppel          2 1451
 model, diffusion and local hindered motions from an                 2 1451
 effective translational scattering law based on a frequency         2 1451
 distribution, and intermolecular coherence after vinyard.           2 1451
